                  "type": "math",
                  "latex": "\\begin{array}{r:c}8.9&7\\end{array}",
                  "display": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "   7 is more than 5, so ",
                  "marks": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "math",
                  "latex": "8.97=8.10",
                  "display": false
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " to 1 decimal place",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Ten tenths carry into the units place; $8.97\\approx9.0$ to 1 decimal place.",
          "worked": "The critical digit is $7$, so round up. Increasing $9$ tenths by one gives $10$ tenths: carry $1$ into the units place and write $0$ in the tenths place.\n$$8.97\\approx9.0\\quad\\text{(1 d.p.)}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 29
      }
